{"seq":1,"slug":"a-viennese-upbringing","title":"A Viennese Upbringing","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/a-viennese-upbringing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-in-vienna","title":"维也纳的成长（1909—1927）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/a-viennese-upbringing/early-life-in-vienna","wordCount":2030,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"journalist-and-economist","title":"记者与早年生涯（1927—1937）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/a-viennese-upbringing/journalist-and-economist","wordCount":2187,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯德鲁克在维也纳的成长与早年生涯。他出生、成长于二十世纪初文化、思想黄金时代的维也纳，深受人文熏陶，出身知识分子家庭，并亲历了旧世界的崩溃——这些赋予了他博大的视野、深厚的人文关怀与对社会整体的关切。在成为管理学家之前，他还曾从事记者、经济分析等工作，广泛历练、观察时代。本章揭示德鲁克思想之博大、深刻的根基。</p>\n"}